{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41522","headline":"赠廖凝 · 韦鼎","name":"赠廖凝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君与白云邻，生涯久忍贫。\n姓名高雅道，寰海许何人。\n岳气秋来早，亭寒果落新。\n几回吟石畔，孤鹤自相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦鼎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41522.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41522","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}